  "description": "In a society where human beings live with “theria\" (wild beasts) - people who can transform into animals - country boy Ho-Jun Min enters a boarding school in a big city.\n\nHojun, who’s always been busy with housekeeping and taking care of young siblings due to his parents busy with all the farm work, strongly determines that he’ll find a girlfriend and enjoy his high school life.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated and edited)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
